#### 3_19 msg - intro text

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_cutscene01"
	val[]: "Dobrodošli na prvi dio završnog ispita. Ovdje ćemo vidjeti koliko ste dobro naučili voziti kamion nakon završetka Akademije."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_cutscene02"
	val[]: "Prvo ćete pričvrstiti prikolicu. Nakon spajanja, vozit ćete kamion oko cijele testne rute."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_cutscene03"
	val[]: "The first section of the test leads you onto some side roads that will take you towards the town centre."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_cutscene04"
	val[]: "The test route includes various kinds of corners and obstacles."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_cutscene05"
	val[]: "A small part of the route goes through the city centre."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_cutscene06"
	val[]: "We'll test your ability to manoeuvre the truck through different obstacles and courses."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_cutscene07"
	val[]: "You'll encounter various situations that will test your attention to your surroundings."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_cutscene08"
	val[]: "We'll have you reverse through an industrial facility."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_cutscene09"
	val[]: "Nakon vožnje po cestama, kroz središte grada i u industrijskom pogonu, uputit ćete se prema sjedištu @@driving_academy@@."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_cutscene10"
	val[]: "A short drive on the road, and you're nearly done."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_cutscene11"
	val[]: "To complete the test, you'll need to park accurately. You can choose whichever manoeuvre works best for you."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_cutscene12"
	val[]: "There's no need to be nervous, you've already learned everything that will be required to pass.<br><br>Good luck!"

#### 3_19 Driving Instructions



	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_forward"
	val[]: "First, you'll need to find and attach the trailer. It's parked up ahead on the right.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Drive towards the trailer. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_coupling"
	val[]: "Turn to the left, then reverse towards the trailer and align yourself with it.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Reverse towards the trailer. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_park_br_on"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Osigurajte kamion. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_connect"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Pritisnite @@imv_nrm_attach@@ za povezivanje prikolice. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_park_br_off"
	val[]: "Prikolica je spojena i kamion je spreman za vožnju.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Oslobodite parkirnu kočnicu. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_b_trailer"
	val[]: "Cesta je zatvorena u svrhu našeg testiranja. Možete odlučiti poštivati ili ignorirati prometne znakove kako smatrate prikladnim.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Vozite prema cesti. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_check01"
	val[]: "Proceed through the first few turns. <br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Continue Driving. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_check02"
	val[]: "After the next turn, there is a slalom made of traffic cones.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Carefully navigate between the traffic cones. </font>"

	#key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_check02a"
	#val[]: "Continue through the roundabout into the town.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Negotiate the roundabout.</font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_check02b"
	val[]: "A few more 90-degree turns await you. <br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Continue driving. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_check03"
	val[]: "Sljedeće skretanje je izuzetno usko i zahtijevat će cijelu cestu da bi se uspješno prešlo.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Skrenite desno i vozite kroz uličicu.</font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_check04"
	val[]: "Turn left out of the alley, then turn right onto the main road.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Continue driving. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_check05"
	val[]: "You can relax for a bit as you drive down the main road. <br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Drive straight on. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_check06"
	val[]: "There are some sharp turns onto and off of the service road.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Carefully drive through the turns. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_check07"
	val[]: "Ulazite u kompliciraniji slalom. Nastavite polako i koristite svoje retrovizore. <br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Nastavite voziti i pažljivo upravljajte kroz slalom.</font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_check08"
	val[]: "Skrenite lijevo u industrijsko područje, pazite na rasvjetni stup.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Skrenite ulijevo. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_check09"
	val[]: "Prepare to reverse.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Turn right and stop in the sectioned off area. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_check10"
	val[]: "Drive in reverse and follow the course to the left behind you.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Start Reversing.</font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_check11"
	val[]: "Follow the course to the left. <br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Continue reversing. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_check12"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Drive forwards and turn right. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_check13"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Continue towards the gate. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_check14"
	val[]: "Wait for the gate to open, then proceed back onto the main road.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Continue Driving. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_check15"
	val[]: "Be careful not to hit the sign.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Make the turn and continue driving. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_check16"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Turn left into the Academy. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_check17"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Continue straight.</font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_check18"
	val[]: "Keep to the outside, as there is a sharp turn after the curve.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Follow the curve.</font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_check19"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Turn left and prepare to park on the left.</font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_check20"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Reverse into the parking spot.</font>"
#!{
	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_stop"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book1_2_01_stop@@"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_end"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book1_2_01_end@@"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_19_start"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book1_2_02_start@@"
 #!}


#@}


#+ Book 1 Scenario 3_20
#@{

#### 3_20 common
	key[]: "aca_scenario_book1_3_20_title"
	val[]: "Završni ispit (2. dio)"

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book1_3_20_desc"
	val[]: "The last part of the final exam awaits you, where the parking skills you've learned in previous scenarios will be evaluated. Park carefully and accurately and you'll be ready to hit the roads of America as a skilled trucker!"

#### 3_20 goal
#!{
	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_20_start"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book1_2_01_start@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_20_stop"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book1_1_03_stop@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_20_end"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book1_2_01_end@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_20_forward"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book1_1_03_forward@@"

#!}


	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_20_park1"
	val[]: "Offset Manoeuvre"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_20_park2"
	val[]: "Dijagonalno parkiranje"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_20_park3"
	val[]: "Vožnja parkiralištem"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_20_park4"
	val[]: "Bočno parkiranje"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_20_park5"
	val[]: "Završno parkiranje"


#### 3_20 msg - intro text

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_20_cutscene01"
	val[]: "Dobrodošli na drugi dio završnog ispita. Premjestit ćemo se na obližnje parkiralište i testirati vaše vještine vožnje unatrag i manevriranja na parkirna mjesta."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_20_cutscene02"
	val[]: "Nekoliko uzastopnih izazova parkiranja čeka na vas da procijenite svoje sposobnosti."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_20_cutscene03"
	val[]: "Ovdje je prostor ograničen, stoga budite oprezni i uzmite si vremena."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_20_cutscene04"
	val[]: "Dobro iskoristite prostor oko sebe i iskoristite sve svoje retrovizore. Sretno!"




#### 3_20 outro text

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_20_outro01"
	val[]: "Congratulations, you've successfully completed the exams for Truck Driving Basics, and learned all the skills necessary to properly manoeuvre your truck."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_20_outro02"
	val[]: "This is the first step in your journey towards realizing your dream of becoming a professional truck driver."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_20_outro03"
	val[]: "You're now ready to head out on to the roads of America and face your first challenges..."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_20_outro04"
	val[]: "...but the adventure has just begun."


#### 3_20 Driving Instructions

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_20_start"
	val[]: "Ne zaboravite biti oprezni i ne žuriti. U redu je ako ne uspijete ući iz prvog pokušaja, važno je da ne oštetite kamion ili one oko sebe. <font face=/font/big_bold.font><br><br>Pripremite se za polazak. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_20_forward"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Vozite naprijed na prvi dio ispita.</font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_20_park1"
	val[]: "Your first task is to demonstrate the offset parking manoeuvre. The spot where you need to back up with the trailer is on your left.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Perform an offset parking manoeuvre.</font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_20_park2"
	val[]: "The next task is to back into a row of stationary trucks. Be careful not to hit the other trucks!<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Perform a diagonal parking manoeuvre.</font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_20_park3"
	val[]: "Continue through the parking lot. Watch out for unexpected situations.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Continue driving.</font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_20_park4"
	val[]: "Now let's try parallel parking between the two trucks by the kerb ahead of you.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Perform a parallel parking manoeuvre.</font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_20_park5"
	val[]: "Još jedan manevar parkiranja s vaše lijeve strane! Možete odlučiti pristupiti ovome kako god želite.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Vozite unatrag do naznačenog područja.</font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_20_park6"
	val[]: "Skoro gotovo. Napustite područje testiranja i parkirajte kamion.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Izađite s područja testiranja ulijevo.</font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_20_stop"
	val[]: "Možete parkirati kamion s desne strane s ostalima.<br><br>@@aca_msg_book1_2_01_stop@@"
#!{
	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_20_end"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book1_2_01_end@@"


#!}

#@}


#+ Book 1 Scenario 3_22
#@{

#### 3_22 common
	key[]: "aca_scenario_book1_3_22_title"
	val[]: "Bočno parkiranje s prikolicom"

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book1_3_22_desc"
	val[]: "U ovom scenariju, razmotrit ćemo paralelno parkiranje sa spojenom prikolicom."

#### 3_22 goal


	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_22_stopmid"
	val[]: "Zaustavljanje u označenom području"
#!{
	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_22_start"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book1_2_01_start@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_22_check1"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book1_3_02_forward@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_22_backward"
	val[]: "@@aca_scenario_book1_1_04_title@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_22_stop"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book1_1_03_stop@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_22_end"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book1_2_01_end@@"
  #!}
#### 3_22 msg - intro text

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_22_cutscene1"
	val[]: "Parallel parking with a trailer is a relevant skill for all truckers.<br>Whether street parking in a big city, or stopping at a rest area in the countryside, it is something every trucker should know how to do."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_22_cutscene2"
	val[]: "Dok prolazite pokraj parkirnog mjesta, pažljivo gledajte ima li dovoljno mjesta za šleper/tegljač i prikolicu. Ovdje smo se pobrinuli da imate dovoljno mjesta."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_22_cutscene3"
	val[]: "Poravnajte se s kamionom ispred parkirnog mjesta. Nemojte mu biti preblizu, držite se na određenoj udaljenosti od njega kako biste imali prostora za rad."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_22_cutscene4"
	val[]: "Naglo skrenite s parkirnog mjesta i počnite voziti unatrag. Ideja je da se prikolica odmah okrene prema parkirnom mjestu."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_22_cutscene5"
	val[]: "Nakon što je prikolica dobro usmjerena u točku, možete je početi pratiti."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_22_cutscene6"
	val[]: "Počnite okretati prikolicu dalje od rubnika prije nego što kotači tegljača/šlepera s vozačeve strane uđu u to mjesto."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_22_cutscene7"
	val[]: "Poravnajte šleper/tegljač s prikolicom i zatim se centrirajte unutar parkirnog mjesta.<br><br>Parkirajte, ugasite motor i osigurajte kamion."

#### 3_22 Driving Instructions

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_22_start"
	val[]: "Možete vidjeti parkirno mjesto ispred sebe, između ostalih kamiona. Dok parkirate, provjerite retrovizore i održavajte siguran razmak između kamiona i prepreka oko vas.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Pripremite se za polazak. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_22_check1"
	val[]: "Krećite se kroz parkiralište kako biste pronašli svoje parkirno mjesto.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Vozite naprijed. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_22_stopmid"
	val[]: "<color value=@@clr_white@@>Prođite pokraj željenog parkirnog mjesta do označenog područja. Odavde možete započeti svoj manevar vožnje unazad.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Zaustavite se na označenom mjestu. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_22_backward"
	val[]: "Okrenite tegljač/šleper od mjesta kako biste počeli okretati prikolicu u njega. Nemojte skrenuti prenaglo ili ćete krenuti prema rubniku. <br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Započnite vožnju unazad. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_22_stop"
	val[]: "Poravnajte prikolicu s točkom. Ako je potrebno, pomičite se unaprijed ili unatrag dok okrećete volan kako biste prilagodili položaj.<br><br>@@aca_msg_book1_2_01_stop@@"
#!{
	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_22_end"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book1_2_01_end@@"
 #!}

#@}

#+ Book 1 Scenario 3_21
#@{
#### 3_21 common
	key[]: "aca_scenario_book1_3_21_title"
	val[]: "Reversing From a 45 Degree Set-Up"

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book1_3_21_desc"
	val[]: "In this scenario, we'll explore the 45 degree set-up for reversing."

#### 3_21 goal
#!{
	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_21_start"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book1_2_01_start@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_21_forward"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book1_1_03_forward@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_21_end"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book1_2_01_end@@"
#!}
	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_21_check1"
	val[]: "Kontrolna točka"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_21_check2"
	val[]: "Getting the right distance for reversing"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_21_stop"
	val[]: "Parkiranje na označenom području"



#### 3_21 msg - intro text

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_21_cutscene1"
	val[]: "In this lesson, we'll take a look at 45 degree parking. When the situation permits, this is the preferred method by many for reversing into parking spots. By starting with the trailer already pointed where you want to go, you have to do less manoeuvring to get parked."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_21_cutscene2"
	val[]: "This kind of set-up also allows you to see further into the parking spot, allowing for increased visibility of where you are going."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_21_cutscene3"
	val[]: "Drive well past the parking spot and line up at a roughly 45 degree angle. You'll want your trailer pointed at the truck on the far side of the parking spot you intend to reverse into."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_21_cutscene4"
	val[]: "Turn the truck away from the spot to push the front of the trailer around, guiding the rear toward the parking spot. Be careful not to overdo it. Once you start turning, it's easier to make the turn sharper than to widen it."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_21_cutscene5"
	val[]: "As the trailer enters the parking space, get the tractor in front of it and align the combination."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_21_cutscene6"
	val[]: "Zaustavite se na predviđenom mjestu i osigurajte kamion."

#### 3_21 Driving Instructions
#!{
	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_21_start"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book1_2_02_start@@"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_21_end"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book1_2_01_end@@"

#!}
	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_21_forward"
	val[]: "There is a parking space on the left. Drive well past it and set up on a 45 degree angle.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Drive ahead. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_21_check1"
	val[]: "Align the truck with the markings.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Stop in the marked area. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_21_check2"
	val[]: "Using the knowledge you gained from previous scenarios, steer the trailer into the parking spot.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Start reversing. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_21_stop"
	val[]: "Nastavite upravljati prikolicom do parkirnog mjesta.<br><br>@@aca_msg_book1_2_01_stop@@"


#@}

