#### double_90 intro

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_double_90_cutscene01"
	val[]: "The course ahead will help familiarize you with turning B-doubles through 90-degree turns with varying difficulty."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_double_90_cutscene02"
	val[]: "Prvih nekoliko zavoja prilično su široki i imaju puno prostora. Iskoristite ih kako biste dobili osjećaj za prikolice iza vas dok skrećete."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_double_90_cutscene03"
	val[]: "From here on, the turns will get tighter and more technical. Approach them slowly, and ensure you drive deep into the turns so that your trailers have room to track around the corner behind you."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_double_90_cutscene04"
	val[]: "Ovo je jedan od najužih zavoja na stazi. Moglo bi vam pomoći ako iskoristite onaj mali prostor zdesna kako biste lakše izvukli prikolice oko onih dosadnih unutarnjih čunjeva."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_double_90_cutscene05"
	val[]: "Sljedeći zavoj uvijek vam mora biti na umu – dok izlazite iz jednog, već planirajte kako ćete se pripremiti za idući."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_double_90_cutscene06"
	val[]: "Uvijek pazite na svoje prikolice sve dok u potpunosti ne zaobiđu sve prepreke."

#### double_90 driving instructions

#!{
	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_double_90_start"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book3_sup_start@@"
#!}
	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_double_90_forward"
	val[]: "Krenite naprijed prema prvom zavoju."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_double_90_check1"
	val[]: "Tijekom vožnje pratite retrovizore kako biste razumjeli na koji način prikolice prate stazu iza vas."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_double_90_check2"
	val[]: "Hvatajte široki luk prije svakog zavoja; to je ključno kako biste si osigurali potreban prostor za izvlačenje prikolica kroz zavoj."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_double_90_check3"
	val[]: "Priprava za sljedećih nekoliko zavoja je ključna, jer nakon njih slijedi vrlo oštar zavoj. Pogreška na samom početku može vas skupo stajati čak i kasnije.<br><br>\nBudite spori i pedantni te obraćajte pozornost na svoju okolinu."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_double_90_check4"
	val[]: "Ovaj je zavoj iznimno oštar i vodi izravno u drugo usko skretanje. Nećete morati razmišljati samo o tome kako ulazite u zavoj, već i kako iz njega izlazite te se postavljate za sljedeći."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_double_90_check5"
	val[]: "Nastavite voziti kroz posljednje zavoje prema određenom području."

#!{
	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_double_90_stop"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book3_sup_stop@@"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_double_90_end"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book3_sup_end@@"
#!}
#@}


#+ Book 3 Scenario justb
#@{

#### justb common
	key[]: "aca_scenario_book3_justb_title"
	val[]: "Prva vožnja unatrag"

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book3_justb_desc"
	val[]: "In this scenario, we'll reverse a B-double combination for the very first time."

#### justb goal

#!{
	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_justb_start"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book3_sup_start@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_justb_forward"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book3_sup_forward@@"
#!}
	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_justb_check1"
	val[]: "Opustite se, ne brinite"

#!{
	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_justb_stop"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book3_sup_stop@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_justb_end"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book3_sup_end@@"
#!}
#### justb msg - intro text

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_justb_cutscene1"
	val[]: "Reversing with B-doubles requires a whole new way of thinking about what you're doing. Rather than just steering a trailer, you are now using your lead trailer to steer one behind it. <br><br> Use this scenario to get a feel for how it all works. There is no specific goal, just take your time and try to understand what is going on."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_justb_cutscene2"
	val[]: "From a straight position, you can turn your truck the same direction you want the rear trailer to go. <br><br>Don't over do it; you only need to get the rear trailer heading towards the direction you want it to go, and then you can align your tractor with the lead trailer and let the rear trailer do its thing."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_justb_cutscene3"
	val[]: "Once your rear trailer is heading where you want it to go, you can steer the lead trailer to follow the same direction. <br><br>Once the lead is following the rear, use the tractor to adjust the angle between the two trailers to either make a tighter turn or a wider sweeping turn."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_justb_cutscene4"
	val[]: "There is no exact formula to get this right, you just have to pay attention to what is going on, learn from your mistakes, and keep practising. <br><br>Once you are satisfied, you can head for the designated area and secure the vehicle. <br><br>Feel free to spend as much time here experimenting as you feel you need."

#### justb Driving Instructions

#!{
	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_justb_start"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book3_sup_start@@"
#!}
	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_justb_forward"
	val[]: "Begin reversing slowly. Start out with small inputs as to not get into a jack-knife right off the bat.<br><br>Try to go straight back, or bring the trailers to the driver's side."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_justb_check1"
	val[]: "Take your time and don't get frustrated. <br><br>Every master was once a beginner."

#!{
	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_justb_stop"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book3_sup_stop@@"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_justb_end"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book3_sup_end@@"
#!}
#@}

#+ Book 3 Scenario justc
#@{

#### justc common
	key[]: "aca_scenario_book3_justc_title"
	val[]: "First Reverse Correction"

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book3_justc_desc"
	val[]: "In this scenario, we'll have to pick up where someone else left off."

#### justc goal

#!{
	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_justc_start"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book3_sup_start@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_justc_forward"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book3_sup_forward@@"
#!}
	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_justc_check1"
	val[]: "Reversing"

#!{
	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_justc_stop"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book3_sup_stop@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_justc_end"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book3_sup_end@@"
#!}
#### justc msg - intro text

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_justc_cutscene1"
	val[]: "Uh oh! Someone else got a little frustrated while reversing and left their truck in the middle of the lot."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_justc_cutscene2"
	val[]: "There will inevitably be times where you will get completely screwed up. Not to worry, just pull forward out of the jack-knife until you have something you can work with. <br><br>If you aren't sure, aim to get it all straight so you have a clean slate."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_justc_cutscene3"
	val[]: "This is a decent position to start from. The rear trailer is still pointed where we want it to go, and we can quickly get the tractor in front of the lead to start steering the whole combination where we want to go."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_justc_cutscene4"
	val[]: "proceed to the designated area and secure the truck. <br><br>Once again, you can practise with this scenario until you are comfortable manoeuvring the trailers."

#### justc Driving Instructions

#!{
	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_justc_start"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book3_sup_start@@"
#!}
	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_justc_forward"
	val[]: "There's no way out of this mess. Pull forward so you have something to work with."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_justc_check1"
	val[]: "Begin reversing."

#!{
	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_justc_stop"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book3_sup_stop@@"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_justc_end"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book3_sup_end@@"
#!}
#@}


#+ Straight Backing
#@{

#### straight_backing common

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book3_straight_backing_title"
	val[]: "Straight Backing"

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book3_straight_backing_desc"
	val[]: "In this scenario, you must reverse a set of B-doubles in a straight line."

#### straight_backing goal

#!{
	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_straight_backing_start"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book3_sup_start@@"
#!}
	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_straight_backing_forward"
	val[]: "Reversing"

#!{
	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_straight_backing_check1"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book3_sup_check1@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_straight_backing_stop"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book3_sup_stop@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_straight_backing_end"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book3_sup_end@@"
#!}
#### straight_backing - intro text

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_straight_backing_cutscene01"
	val[]: "Straight backing may seem easier at first glance, but it is actually much more difficult. <br><br>Rather than just increasing or decreasing the angle between the trailers on one side, you must now work both sides to keep the combination straight."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_straight_backing_cutscene02"
	val[]: "Start with relatively small corrections. It's okay if you end up wiggling and waggling to each side, just keep in mind that you will need to hold the angle between the truck and the lead trailer a bit longer to change the angle between the lead and rear trailers."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_straight_backing_cutscene03"
	val[]: "You may need to make some quite large manoeuvres with the tractor to keep the rear trailer pointed where you want it, but just try not to over-do it in the first place and you won't have to."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_straight_backing_cutscene04"
	val[]: "You can pull forward to correct yourself as many times as necessary. As long as you end up in the parking spot safely, the rest is trivial."

#### Straight Backing Driving Instructions

#!{
	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_straight_backing_start"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book3_sup_start@@"
#!}
	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_straight_backing_forward"
	val[]: "Begin reversing slowly."

#!{
	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_straight_backing_check1"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book3_sup_check1@@"
#!}
	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_straight_backing_stop"
	val[]: "Straighten up and stop in the designated area."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_straight_backing_end"
	val[]: "Secure the vehicle and shut off the engine."

#@}


#+ Correcting Straight Backing
#@{

#### correcting_straight_backing common

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book3_correcting_straight_backing_title"
	val[]: "Straight Backing Correction"

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book3_correcting_straight_backing_desc"
	val[]: "In this scenario, you will take the wheel after someone else has already attempted a straight reverse. Correct their mistake and park the truck in the designated spot."

#### correcting_straight_backing goal

#!{
	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_correcting_straight_backing_start"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book3_sup_start@@"
#!}
	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_correcting_straight_backing_forward"
	val[]: "Straightening Up"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_correcting_straight_backing_check1"
	val[]: "Reversing"

#!{
	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_correcting_straight_backing_stop"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book3_sup_stop@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_correcting_straight_backing_end"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book3_sup_end@@"
#!}
#### correcting_straight_backing - intro text

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_correcting_straight_cutscene01"
	val[]: "Someone has attempted to reverse this combination into the parking spot and had a little trouble. Now it's up to you to fix it!"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_correcting_straight_cutscene02"
	val[]: "The first step is to pull forward and get everything straightened out into something we can work with. It's crucial to have the rear trailer pointed where you want it to go."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_correcting_straight_cutscene03"
	val[]: "In this case, we've chosen to go more towards the driver side. This will give us a better view of what we are doing as we reverse, and allow us to work from one side. <br><br>Remember, you are steering the rear trailer with the lead, so don't focus on the tractor so much."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_correcting_straight_cutscene04"
	val[]: "The combination is more or less where we need it, but let's pull forward again to centre it properly."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_correcting_straight_cutscene05"
	val[]: "From here, we will very delicately reverse into place, making sure the rear trailer stays perfectly on track."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_correcting_straight_cutscene06"
	val[]: "Now we can line up the lead trailer and the tractor itself."

#### correcting_Straight_Backing Driving Instructions

#!{
	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_correcting_straight_backing_start"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book3_sup_start@@"
#!}
	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_correcting_straight_backing_forward"
	val[]: "Pull forward and straighten everything up. <br><br>Once you are satisfied, reverse into the designated area."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_correcting_straight_backing_check1"
	val[]: "Vozite unatrag prema označenom području."

#!{
	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_correcting_straight_backing_stop"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book3_sup_stop@@"
#!}
	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_correcting_straight_backing_end"
	val[]: "Secure the vehicle and shut off the engine."

#@}


#+ Book 3 Scenario backing_90_tight
#@{

#### backing_90_tight common
	key[]: "aca_scenario_book3_backing_90_tight_title"
	val[]: "90-degree Backing"

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book3_backing_90_tight_desc"
	val[]: "In this scenario, you'll use a 90-degree backing manoeuvre to park in a row of other trucks."

#### backing_90_tight goal

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_backing_90_tight_check1"
	val[]: "U-turn"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_backing_90_tight_check2"
	val[]: "Setting Up"

		key[]: "aca_goal_book3_backing_90_tight_check3"
	val[]: "Reversing"

#!{
		key[]: "aca_goal_book3_backing_90_tight_stop"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book3_sup_stop@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_backing_90_tight_end"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book3_sup_end@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_backing_90_tight_start"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book3_sup_start@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book3_backing_90_tight_forward"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book3_sup_forward@@"
#!}
#### backing_90_tight msg - intro text

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_cutscene1"
	val[]: "Reversing to the side is easier with B-doubles, as you will have a clearer vantage point out of the side window of everything going on."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_cutscene2"
	val[]: "Prvo, vozite naprijed i polukružno se okrenite na kraju reda. To će vam omogućiti da se postavite s vidljive strane, kako biste bolje vidjeli situaciju kroz prozor s vozačeve strane."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_cutscene3"
	val[]: "You may choose to set up the trailers however you see fit, perhaps with the rear trailer already pointing towards the spot. In this case, we will start from a straight position. <br><br>Remember to keep it simple - steer the rear trailer with the lead."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_cutscene4"
	val[]: "Steer the lead trailer slightly away from the parking spot, and the rear trailer will start to point towards the spot. From there, adjust the angle between the lead and rear trailer to maintain a nice, smooth arch into the parking spot."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_cutscene5"
	val[]: "Remember, if the rear trailer is coming in too tight, then you must straighten the angle of the combination some. If it is going too wide, then get the angle sharper."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_cutscene6"
	val[]: "Adjustments you make with the tractor have half as much affect on the rear trailer as they do on the lead, so don't be afraid to really work your tractor."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_cutscene7"
	val[]: "At this point, you must start planning ahead. You must also get the lead trailer into the spot as well, so start a plan to get it straight in front of the rear."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_cutscene8"
	val[]: "It is very rare to get the trailers in on the first attempt. In this case, we waited too long to straighten up the lead, and now the rear is drifting off path. <br><br>No problem, pull forward and try again."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_cutscene9"
	val[]: "Really work that wheel, and get those trailers where you want them. You can pull forward as many times as you need to until you are satisfied."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_cutscene10"
	val[]: "And just like that, we've successfully parked B-doubles."

#### backing_90_tight Driving Instructions

#!{
	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_start"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book3_sup_start@@"
#!}
	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_forward"
	val[]: "Drive forward to the end of the lot and turn around."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_check1"
	val[]: "Remember to make a wide turn."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_check2"
	val[]: "Continue forward until you feel you have adequate room to manoeuvre, then start reversing."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_check3"
	val[]: "Reverse into the parking spot."

#!{
	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_stop"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book3_sup_stop@@"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_backing_90_tight_end"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book3_sup_end@@"
#!}
#@}


