#### finex msg - intro text

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_finex_cutscene1"
	val[]: "Welcome to the final exam. We've laid out some realistic situations that you could encounter out on the road to see how you are able to handle them. As always, take your time and be precise. <br><br>Good luck!"

#### finex Driving Instructions

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_finex_check0"
	val[]: "The way ahead is blocked, turn around in the space provided."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_finex_check1"
	val[]: "Continue towards the city centre."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_finex_check2"
	val[]: "Postignite brzinu od najmanje 37 mph (60 km/h) dok se krećete prema centru grada."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_finex_check22"
	val[]: "Prepare to brake."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_finex_speed"
	val[]: "You failed to reach a speed of 37 mph (60 km/h)"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_finex_check4"
	val[]: "Continue driving through the course."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book3_finex_check5"
	val[]: "There's a parking spot for you in the row of trucks to the left. Reverse in and park."

